---
description: Canonical container-first project contract
globs: ["**/*"]
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and obey `AGENTS.md` and the canonical files under `.ai/` before changing anything.

Key rules:

- Every run, lint, test, database query, and CI step goes through Podman, normally via `make`.
- Never install runtimes, package managers, or databases on the host.
- Never use Docker.
- The stack is pinned in `project.env`; the AI tool is personal and never pinned.
- Do not add policy to tool-specific files. Update `AGENTS.md` / `.ai/` first.
- Shared roles live in `.ai/agents/`; team rules in `.ai/teams/`.

Fast path: `make doctor`, `make up`, `make lint`, `make test`, `make ci`.
